@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
<p>
    CipherVault stores passwords, API keys, credit-card details, and secure notes
    using ASP.NET Core Data Protection. All confidential content is encrypted before
    being written to the database; only non-sensitive metadata is stored in plaintext
    to allow search and filtering.
</p>
<p class="text-danger">
    <strong>Security disclaimer:</strong> This is an educational/student project.
    It must not be marketed as a production-grade password manager unless its
    cryptographic design, key management, authentication, and deployment configuration
    have been independently audited.
</p>